    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i look at my dad and my brothers and it’s like... it’s just the same story every time. the drinking, the losing everything, the way everyone just ends up broken. i feel like i’m just waiting for my turn to ruin everything too. like the bad stuff is just in my blood and it's inevitable.",
