      "content": "it's not that simple though. even when i try to be different, i feel like i'm just dragging everyone else down with me. like, my mistakes just cause more pain for the people i love. sometimes it feels like the only way to actually stop the damage is to just... not be a part of it anymore. like the cycle only stops if the person carrying it stops.",
